# Skills from agent_config/skills to keep installed in Matt's Metamate 3
# settings, one directory name per line. bin/metamate-skills-sync uploads each
# as a private ("Only Me") catalog skill, installs it for Metamate 3, publishes
# a new revision when its files change, and uninstalls a skill dropped from
# this list (the catalog copy is kept).
#
# Why a list: Metamate sessions take their skills from settings, not from
# ~/.claude/skills (agentcloud spec 2783). Hosted Claude Code still finds the
# ~/checkoutN/.claude/skills links sync.sh makes, so this list is for what the
# other harnesses need -- Metamate's own agent, Codex, Muse -- and for chats
# with no checkout. Each entry costs context in every Metamate session.

metamate-checkouts
personal-development-setup-and-env
reviewing-changes
show-in-nvim
